  "structure": {
    "block_count": 115,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "5 Delicious DIY Pregnancy Mocktails (With Bump-Friendly Benefits!)",
        "text_sha256": "80613b4dd6e3f2925162359efaec41fca43a3a2ec836133439b61f8bece38078",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "by Cynthia Sass, M.P.H., M.A., R.D.",
        "text_sha256": "8b07adb853ef48d093d200b100f96601d74ddb45bb9e115b844b1cf8d35c0c06",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Updates to copy, sources, and formatting.",
        "text_sha256": "2bf448333081ffc8549a45a6c4b7fc711ee4b93575f0fffd3c4a6212c13581c2",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pregnancy mocktails",
        "text_sha256": "1f842b94e8d36b101fce3b585764660dcedb4ba613d7502ba5f17040571dff20",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Cheers to these non-alcoholic drinks, created by a nutritionist: They're filled with power ingredients that are extra healthy for moms-to-be.",
        "text_sha256": "651c6a69adcc4e7dc947e855170800a1826c21c5b41293ba7533894391fe6ff6",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Whether you are expecting a baby, hosting a friend's baby shower, or are just not in the mood to drink, mocktails — cocktails minus the alcohol — are a welcome trend.",
        "text_sha256": "d28e4467cfab51d3484076476ce79943de81c2175e65fd7487bf6042017dc66f",
        "word_count": 31
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Not only are mocktails on the menu at more and more restaurants, but they're also easy to make at home.",
        "text_sha256": "c50f3544a8b06539599834040561dde17ba11205359d867ba3da60e4a621456e",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“I love mixing a little bit of any juice (like orange, pineapple, cranberry, or apple cider) and bubbly water in a fancy glass and adding fresh or frozen fruit! It makes it feel fancy and it's hydrating but with less sugar than drinking mostly juice,” says What to Expect Community mom AKrafty23.",
        "text_sha256": "8ab7ca3d56bf5e13c0fa433fe616c9ebb161a6bc246765eaff5d21c5833cdcc1",
        "word_count": 52
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "As a nutritionist, I recommend DIY mocktails made with ingredients that nourish you during pregnancy and help support baby's development. These five delicious no-alcohol cocktails deliver on both counts. While all the ingredients in these mocktails are considered safe during pregnancy, be sure to check in with your doctor before consuming anything that is new to you.",
        "text_sha256": "5b650e516bde44e220874549b891cfab0f6ff9e1ec16d1b3f5b8d094e4764a61",
        "word_count": 57
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Key-Takeaways",
        "text_sha256": "c2a9bcce7698ee0702f3d963a8b82556c80a5c4c5eff821a1c928b50c51d08da",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Mocktails let you join the toast — no alcohol required. Pick nutrient-packed sips (think citrus, chia, mango, ginger) to support immunity, digestion, and baby's growth.",
        "text_sha256": "5dc2d62de37d3ced6e794d240a90fba1f9d4300570fb52080655a8138d047e58",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Hydration matters more when you’re expecting. Your fluid needs rise to about 8–12 cups daily, and these mocktails help you meet that goal deliciously.",
        "text_sha256": "cbee55456c27f3e132ce2f29e20ee7c2dd9d9816aed312b418432420462de05e",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Keep it simple and pregnancy-safe. The ingredients here are generally safe, but check with your doctor before trying anything new to you.",
        "text_sha256": "9100b0a73e72d1248d139422ba909e8dfedf40eb2c2d92d3d0a02b97561d962c",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Best mocktail recipes for pregnancy",
        "text_sha256": "fa9f628ac9a7101905282df44b4aec95e229a491cc7161eda138bac086440d88",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Grapefruit Lime Mockgarita",
        "text_sha256": "986f42e996f538469f2e57a695e575e0a299534ba56ef09c4a555f3a63b291c9",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "grapefruit lime mockgarita",
        "text_sha256": "bdc469f0a5f1828237a0f7486e292948d3ca6caa64acb6bf325951b03dd5bf4c",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Ingredients:",
        "text_sha256": "181b526eb39cac0d0467bd58a40614d5088f9768821bd8139b42be6f20f1e7a1",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Ice",
        "text_sha256": "2a1a6355ed7e30b0eea3a7967a31e9c42f6afa817fbf6555df3befdf05ae38e0",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/3 cup fresh squeezed grapefruit juice",
        "text_sha256": "ce051f54072b4a43b5a531c0a094ceb32737aff9e3aaa89ae8720592b41ddfdf",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Juice from half of a fresh squeezed lime",
        "text_sha256": "b539f2f178901ef06232e08b25e65ba0d730c1117fd7ecbf95513292f9750408",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/4 cup chilled filtered water",
        "text_sha256": "81a158315cbcb79576e5e3000a2ed57559f447790d223f85be64e4d3e306b29e",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1 teaspoon of pure maple syrup",
        "text_sha256": "80b3296dc0e451087f006af8462c8ae7e8b75658a47a15a96e9fa6742cfa874e",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "How to make it:",
        "text_sha256": "d5db46aca8f923d9891fa6dc1942140cf19ed2bcf2248bd8b712a2a8fe3223c7",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "In a cocktail shaker, combine a handful of ice with grapefruit juice, lime juice, filtered water, and maple syrup.",
        "text_sha256": "4dd839698f2db4086de70eaaa4332c42a038d4a70bcc09ff5f3ec04f7ea08ee7",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Shake well.",
        "text_sha256": "72873533e32066b1c43bb9a1880e5d12c42f8a535cfc2cc940ed97bcc94aa642",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Add 5-6 ice cubes to serving glass, pour in mocktail, and garnish with a slice of lime.",
        "text_sha256": "0b0b43467a9909c6cd00d62485d8c1f829ba568270188953e838008e99b55376",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Why it's healthy:",
        "text_sha256": "4cd86587baaa222bcb517ec68c2189c1e54bf810bcba832a2314472779c10ad9",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You get a double dose of vitamin C, thanks to the two citrus juices. In addition to supporting immunity, vitamin C helps produce collagen, which helps keep skin strong and elastic. The manganese provided by the maple syrup helps support baby's bone and cartilage formation.",
        "text_sha256": "07ab13ca16170c467ea4bcecbd3402b322b23cc97b9c8702d6cb904f0872465b",
        "word_count": 45
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Not to mention, this mocktail is hydrating, which is even more important during pregnancy . Your blood volume increases by as much as 50% when you're expecting, and so your total fluid needs increase to about 8 to 12 cups a day.",
        "text_sha256": "2edbb8fa02080162e8fb1ba96f634c3f42f1b8172450393a3344fea7d22ea794",
        "word_count": 42
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Blueberry Chia Crush",
        "text_sha256": "170e1a9de88b59152a8acb47ae95b7c03edfc15368f7365ab4cac8acb7be7f11",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "blueberry chia crush",
        "text_sha256": "7ac529b6acada55e5b83b1162fcd352f59c125188fdef79ecdd6cb6105a1c2b6",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Ingredients:",
        "text_sha256": "181b526eb39cac0d0467bd58a40614d5088f9768821bd8139b42be6f20f1e7a1",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
