        "text_sha256": "56ac8cbc5ec27ca67efd033d283dca32fb4848320efeda2e5aa1ccc752a283d8",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/2 cup sparkling water",
        "text_sha256": "c7da993b48944a9bbf5cd0a81025a5f110719c2050b8a2179e2f603beea1d1c3",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "How to make it:",
        "text_sha256": "d5db46aca8f923d9891fa6dc1942140cf19ed2bcf2248bd8b712a2a8fe3223c7",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "In a mini blender, combine blueberries, filtered water, lime juice, chia seeds, and maple syrup.",
        "text_sha256": "4532705466eab6e89a3c48ea783f7188ee1c2de38a951ba173a5ad3edb11e597",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Whip until smooth, then transfer to a cocktail glass and let sit for 5 minutes.",
        "text_sha256": "ee2d4d4db8d2ca6b43b788f45a3d025bf4dd80dccc0ae155f8546dba9b0743f2",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000041",
        "block_index": 41,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Add 5-6 ice cubes and sparkling water.",
        "text_sha256": "351b5d68560a272f8b65a608a8814f9e1d37e5eade24cc4775a96c2f569fea78",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000042",
        "block_index": 42,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Stir well and garnish with whole blueberries.",
        "text_sha256": "b229f11802c12cca22bdd5da63015e7308abf7136fbfd091360b6b69c5d6bd84",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000043",
        "block_index": 43,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Why it's healthy:",
        "text_sha256": "4cd86587baaa222bcb517ec68c2189c1e54bf810bcba832a2314472779c10ad9",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000044",
        "block_index": 44,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Chia seeds supply iron , which pregnant women particularly need because of their expanding blood volume. They also serve up calcium , which plays a role in fetal bone and teeth development. Plus, the seeds' fiber helps regulate blood sugar levels, fend off constipation, and prevent hemorrhoids. Blueberries — often referred to as \"the king of antioxidants\" — can help keep blood pressure under control and prevent urinary tract infections.",
        "text_sha256": "9f62a59af78fd2d04d5511dd27ede1dfc04ededbd82236264b9426fcc3dd80cd",
        "word_count": 70
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000045",
        "block_index": 45,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Mango Mint Quencher",
        "text_sha256": "9c02035e61db36aa0f65e8a1bb2f63f4ec4a864d9266fcace91855b9be6a0003",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000046",
        "block_index": 46,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "mango mint quencher",
        "text_sha256": "b806d78c8d8ac328ea58619c5455c8eebaa4ae86a5d2999b34211f067d8a7e69",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000047",
        "block_index": 47,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Ingredients:",
        "text_sha256": "181b526eb39cac0d0467bd58a40614d5088f9768821bd8139b42be6f20f1e7a1",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000048",
        "block_index": 48,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "3/4 cup fresh mango",
        "text_sha256": "88f4e8dd87a0455b123cfd08d24c2aab0b43d1a4fb1eeb9035188916528e51d5",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000049",
        "block_index": 49,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/2 tablespoon fresh squeezed lemon juice",
        "text_sha256": "4957bc4b49e899346be2fe401c54f7d1e5c61595572fb893dc32f4f6cdcbd574",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000050",
        "block_index": 50,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/2 cup pure coconut water",
        "text_sha256": "12fd1b9bc25f4c18ca0f267db0f41bb852ac69e56018c371eeb4ec5c02250852",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000051",
        "block_index": 51,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "2-3 fresh mint leaves",
        "text_sha256": "8ebeb3df500093b0f257d9b6a4c7edac59693625e97672079ce94afb3eef9ea0",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000052",
        "block_index": 52,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "4-5 ice cubes",
        "text_sha256": "1ed241bbf427d6b4b5788fbe83426ab113797f5f679f73f12260ac95dfc09350",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000053",
        "block_index": 53,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "How to make it:",
        "text_sha256": "d5db46aca8f923d9891fa6dc1942140cf19ed2bcf2248bd8b712a2a8fe3223c7",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000054",
        "block_index": 54,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "In a mini blender, combine mango, lemon juice, coconut water, mint leaves, and ice cubes.",
        "text_sha256": "de690087ea76e2c697840efe078b55ae73cc6bed7e81f45f0b5928d216f0e794",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000055",
        "block_index": 55,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Blend until smooth.",
        "text_sha256": "af8ff849e76a7207fd079b6cf5ca8d7a30c41843e73121cbee22222ea0ef0bc6",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000056",
        "block_index": 56,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Pour into glass and garnish with fresh mint.",
        "text_sha256": "b1d9653cc15a409b7e9a95135bce20c369b3dbf68bf4c6eac20232a979d0ea1a",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000057",
        "block_index": 57,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Why it's healthy:",
        "text_sha256": "4cd86587baaa222bcb517ec68c2189c1e54bf810bcba832a2314472779c10ad9",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000058",
        "block_index": 58,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Mangoes are bursting with vitamins A and C, which are both vital for strong immunity. The potassium in coconut water helps regulate blood pressure and thwarts excess fluid retention, and it may even help thwart leg cramps. Got morning sickness? Mint has been shown to ease pregnancy nausea .",
        "text_sha256": "885474d3c49bd95f29dfd3bf880e5fd9eba8116840277d0221b7d2e3d41e4f00",
        "word_count": 49
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000059",
        "block_index": 59,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Pina Mocklada",
        "text_sha256": "1647f88d26027237c9a3eedbf2695e17bbd26683abc77bd08a326b80f23a0d26",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000060",
        "block_index": 60,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "pina mocklada",
        "text_sha256": "6922e18f0432c1b6bd4ea4e68e2a000eeff847287970d3e148e35d6ba9aa81ca",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000061",
        "block_index": 61,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Ingredients:",
        "text_sha256": "181b526eb39cac0d0467bd58a40614d5088f9768821bd8139b42be6f20f1e7a1",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000062",
        "block_index": 62,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "3/4 cup frozen pineapple chunks",
        "text_sha256": "d94c6d0ab9de254312e15a0bf208e0bfb47ed726b6d3529aec413cc1960912a3",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000063",
        "block_index": 63,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/2 cup frozen banana slices",
        "text_sha256": "cd2259b160512f9eecff1fc0499d045d2f031518507de50b3b630c6bda7a3f66",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000064",
        "block_index": 64,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "3/4 cup unsweetened coconut milk",
        "text_sha256": "86ac5f9e88bfbe5a6ba2df806b2808f02d4e07a1d2e7b3668d6ba74ba5a4e9ec",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000065",
        "block_index": 65,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/4 teaspoon fresh grated ginger root",
        "text_sha256": "791d4397094c340b1207afabf374231c5d720d6e65ca6ddc72df89ddd7688e06",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000066",
        "block_index": 66,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1 teaspoon blackstrap molasses",
        "text_sha256": "4b5e2737480c9109c73fd944d3cb992ebc09737887bd304518b956b667b3988b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000067",
        "block_index": 67,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/2 teaspoon unsweetened shredded coconut",
        "text_sha256": "46997ff34acdf65d48291089a269ee83702c52a9525dc41bbeba1b1615652f61",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000068",
        "block_index": 68,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "How to make it:",
        "text_sha256": "d5db46aca8f923d9891fa6dc1942140cf19ed2bcf2248bd8b712a2a8fe3223c7",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000069",
        "block_index": 69,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "In a mini blender, combine pineapple, banana, coconut milk, ginger root, and blackstrap molasses.",
        "text_sha256": "c3c9472592dd520c43d3b15e1f199261d0634fd6bd685a1611d20112055ce924",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000070",
        "block_index": 70,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Blend until smooth.",
        "text_sha256": "af8ff849e76a7207fd079b6cf5ca8d7a30c41843e73121cbee22222ea0ef0bc6",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000071",
        "block_index": 71,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Transfer to glass and garnish with unsweetened shredded coconut.",
        "text_sha256": "18542fddb14671ee84e19d353ef874043322b946e71753ebc94ca9e6beadebe4",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000072",
        "block_index": 72,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Why it's healthy:",
        "text_sha256": "4cd86587baaa222bcb517ec68c2189c1e54bf810bcba832a2314472779c10ad9",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000073",
        "block_index": 73,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pineapple’s magnesium helps prevent fatigue and improve relaxation and sleep (so important during pregnancy!). The vitamin B6 in bananas not only may help with nausea, but it also plays a part in baby's brain and nervous system development. Blackstrap molasses is a good source of iron, a mineral that fights pregnancy fatigue and contributes to healthy hormone production.",
        "text_sha256": "9637f7b639407782d3ff9d6636b8a6ca4b8580e1c0c606be87472effe4aa390f",
        "word_count": 58
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000074",
        "block_index": 74,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Pomegranate Cosmo",
        "text_sha256": "d5d6bf66525312935c5aa33e44f7f1d90f36808386225c71763a3dfeb540e06f",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000075",
        "block_index": 75,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "pomegranate cosmo",
        "text_sha256": "c4ab3ee810f8e3d3674abee9848876ed39a220745c20dcb00508c8416905d8a6",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000076",
        "block_index": 76,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Ingredients:",
        "text_sha256": "181b526eb39cac0d0467bd58a40614d5088f9768821bd8139b42be6f20f1e7a1",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000077",
        "block_index": 77,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Ice",
        "text_sha256": "2a1a6355ed7e30b0eea3a7967a31e9c42f6afa817fbf6555df3befdf05ae38e0",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000078",
        "block_index": 78,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/2 cup 100% pomegranate juice",
        "text_sha256": "6b62e5fbcea56024dbd5507289a1851137ffa07514357ef6580759fb683dd037",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000079",
        "block_index": 79,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/4 cup chilled filtered water",
        "text_sha256": "81a158315cbcb79576e5e3000a2ed57559f447790d223f85be64e4d3e306b29e",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000080",
        "block_index": 80,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Juice from half a lemon",
        "text_sha256": "21585cda6b7508d1f25d2a5e8941a40da383a2ea9b50068ccd00e74d39d93d3a",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000081",
        "block_index": 81,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1 teaspoon pure maple syrup",
        "text_sha256": "56ac8cbc5ec27ca67efd033d283dca32fb4848320efeda2e5aa1ccc752a283d8",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000082",
        "block_index": 82,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1/4 teaspoon fresh grated ginger root",
        "text_sha256": "791d4397094c340b1207afabf374231c5d720d6e65ca6ddc72df89ddd7688e06",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000083",
        "block_index": 83,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Pomegranate seeds (for garnish)",
        "text_sha256": "5bca4b107c45424427845fec79f6bdbf4bf679bdf28fca9f91d567322a332a3d",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000084",
        "block_index": 84,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "How to make it:",
        "text_sha256": "d5db46aca8f923d9891fa6dc1942140cf19ed2bcf2248bd8b712a2a8fe3223c7",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000085",
        "block_index": 85,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "In a cocktail shaker, combine a handful of ice with pomegranate juice, chilled filtered water, lemon juice, maple syrup, and ginger root.",
        "text_sha256": "ed6272110b9b10b2dc827b0360f1308fff80de022780d8d2b285cbf355801bcb",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000086",
        "block_index": 86,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Shake well.",
        "text_sha256": "72873533e32066b1c43bb9a1880e5d12c42f8a535cfc2cc940ed97bcc94aa642",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000087",
        "block_index": 87,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Pour into glass and garnish with a few whole pomegranate arils.",
        "text_sha256": "ac25c19b3ffc6068a3816d43539febf1a930ebd8043ae9e7bbb86abfc7845d90",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000088",
        "block_index": 88,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Why it's healthy:",
        "text_sha256": "4cd86587baaa222bcb517ec68c2189c1e54bf810bcba832a2314472779c10ad9",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000089",
        "block_index": 89,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Drinking pomegranate juice during pregnancy may help protect the placenta from injury risk, according to research published in the American Journal of Physiology: Endocrinology and Metabolism . Pomegranate also gives you vitamin K, which helps allow blood to clot properly to prevent excess bleeding. And if you're queasy, you'll appreciate this: Fresh grated ginger root — a potent source of anti-inflammatory antioxidants — may help combat morning sickness.",
        "text_sha256": "f9c64ca102c363f7070d4c2e207db39a01e946224999e98e644517c4517f2600",
        "word_count": 68
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000090",
        "block_index": 90,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Craving more bump-friendly sips and snacks? Download the What to Expect app for easy, hit-the-spot menu ideas, weekly tips, and recipes.",
        "text_sha256": "1597e562018d2875b16b5aa7b35ada435f6e69476c45a371beed20c12e771afa",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000091",
        "block_index": 91,
        "block_type": "blockquote",
        "tag": "blockquote",
